## Trap notes

- Amending a pushed commit rotates the hash → drift refs go stale (happened twice today). Pin refs AFTER the final hash, or expect a `docs(drift): pin` follow-up commit.
- `nv check-banned-types.sh` bans literal `: unknown` in source strings.
- Terminal tool uses `sh` (no bash-isms: no `${PIPESTATUS[@]}`, no `[[ ]]`).
- A running demo gateway (7300 + 7200) breaks consumer-ux + dashboard-factory tests — stop it before full-suite runs.
- Shell quote semantics now: quotes group spaces + strip pairs; NO backslash escapes (v1).

